    "durationMs": 185476,
    "finalText": "The URL shortener is complete and fully verified. All 38 end-to-end HTTP checks pass, and persistence across restart is confirmed.\n\nWhat I built:\n\n- **Routes** (`routes/api.php` + `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`): `POST /links`, `GET /links`, `GET /links/{code}`, `GET /r/{code}` — registered at the root, no `/api` prefix, no throttling.\n- **`app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php`**: \n  - URL validation requires an absolute http/https URL with a host (via `FILTER_VALIDATE_URL` + `parse_url`); custom codes must match `[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}`; generated codes are 8 random chars with collision retry.\n  - Response codes exactly per spec: 201 with `{\"code\",\"url\",\"clicks\":0}` (URL echoed unchanged), 409 on duplicate custom code (enforced by a case-sensitive unique index), 404 JSON for unknown codes, 422 JSON with an `error` field for malformed JSON/invalid url/invalid code (I decode the raw body myself so malformed JSON yields 422, not Laravel's default 400).\n  - Redirects are 302 with the raw stored URL in `Location` and increment clicks once via an atomic SQL increment.\n- **Persistence**: Eloquent `Link` model + migration (`code` unique, `url` text, `clicks` counter) on the provided MySQL, configured entirely from `DB_*` env vars (I removed the sqlite line from `.env` so nothing is hard-coded).\n- **`start.sh`** (executable): applies pending migrations then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` in the foreground; verified it reports \"Nothing to migrate\" on restart.\n- **README**: \"Starting the server\" section plus an endpoint reference.\n\nVerification highlights: 38/38 checks including generated-code shape, url echo fidelity, duplicate 409, all 422 variants (malformed JSON, missing/invalid url, bad code types/lengths), raw `Location` header equality, ascending list order with matching `total`, integer `clicks`, and a restart test where clicks survived (2 → 3 after one more redirect). Test data was cleared and the test server stopped when finished."
